# KEYS ONLY - generated by `mise run pz:secrets:examples` from the committed adapter
# and key schemas; `mise run pz:secrets:examples:check` (CI) keeps it current.
# Nobody fills this file and no task reads it: every value comes from pz-secretctl
# (the agent vault). Recipes: references/secrets.md of the pzagent-adw-context skill.

# Application secrets per environment: what pz:provider:env:apply and Kubernetes
# provisioning write into the Dokploy Environment or the Secret. Image variables are
# set by deployment; non-secret settings live in Compose files and ConfigMaps in Git;
# local development inputs, if any, live in .env.local.example.

# No environment declares an application secret.
